  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe \"System\" Tracker Models no longer show up in the Calibration Mirror, other Tracker Models (e.g. Spheres) will still show up though.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**\n\n1. Launch VRChat in VR with FBT Trackers\n\n2. Go to the Main Menu Tracking & IK Settings\n\n3. Change the Tracker Model to \"System\"\n\n4. Enable the Calibration Mirror in the Action Menu\n\n5. Enter Calibration Mode\n\nIf you do this you will notice that your Trackers wont show up.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nThe \"System\" Tracker Models should show up in the Calibration Mirror, just like other Tracker Models do.",
